SUiVbE48cfvqF8GTHp9CE.webp) 8.25% - 11.20%\n\n![SBI Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6LuvpQu1AjCfFOMusgBFDVfK8REKUqT5rwwi9psG.webp) 8.05%-8.55%\n\n## Location of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Google Map\n\n---\n\n### Location AV\n\nExperience location of Lodha Malabar from the comfort of your home\n\n---\n\n### About walkeshwar\n\nA prestigious and historic South Mumbai locality, Walkeshwar is home to the Governor’s residence (Raj Bhavan) and several ancient temples. Highlights include the Banganga Tank, a holy water body surrounded by old temples and monasteries, and the stunning views of the Arabian Sea. It is a quiet, leafy enclave that offers a unique mix of spiritual heritage and high-end residential living at the southern tip of the Malabar Hill.\n\n**Walkeshwar Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\n* Charni Road\n* Grant Road\n* Maheshwari Devi Temple\n* Marine Lines Railway station\n* Mumbai Central\n* Malbar Hill Police Station Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Sardar Pav Bhaji\n* Haji Ali Juice Centre\n* Shalimar Restaurant\n* Sukh Sagar\n* Pizza By The Bay\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Walsingham House School\n* Gopi Birla Memorial School\n* ORCHIDS The International School - CBSE School in Masjid Bunder\n* Aditya Birla World Academy\n* Bhavans College\n\n**Hospitals in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Narayana Health SRCC Children's Hospital, Mumbai\n* Wockhardt Hospitals, Mumbai Central\n* Dr. Manish S Shah Clinic | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Walkeshwar**\n\n* CR2 Shopping Mall\n* Sumitra Market\n* City Centre Mumbai\n* Rubberwala The Platinum Mall\n\n## About Lodha Group\n\n![Lodha Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/nZtsHoi2qQf6OmzYZz6eOplTaTtYJWeqxmkzd7HT.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 1980\n* [Projects - 124](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/lodha-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Lodha Group\n\nLodha Group is a pre-eminent Indian real estate developer renowned for its luxurious residential and commercial projects. Originating in 1980 under the visionary leadersh\n\nread more\n\nip of Mangal Prabhat Lodha, the company has evolved into a multinational conglomerate with a substantial footprint across India's major metropolitan areas and London. Synonymous with opulence and quality, Lodha has redefined the luxury living experience with iconic projects like Lodha Altamount and The World Towers. Beyond luxury, the group's portfolio encompasses a diverse range of properties, catering to various market segments. Their commitment to innovation is exemplified in large-scale integrated townships like Palava, which offer residents a holistic lifestyle. Backed by a strong financial foundation and a steadfast dedication to customer satisfaction, Lodha Group has solidified its position as a dominant force in India's real estate landscape.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Lodha Malabar\n\n![P51900034949.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/5zUsq8zHiJadrkzqfUSw3b0XyOTyF1HRjvNJ28k6.webp) P51900034949\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Lodha Malabar\n\nWhat is the address of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar is located at Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Lodha Malabar?\n\nLodha Malabar Walkeshwar RERA number is P51900034949.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nLodha Malabar offers premium 4,5 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Walkeshwar.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nLodha Malabar flat price in Walkeshwar starts at ₹ Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar project?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar project boasts G+31 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar