l parts of South Mumbai. \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Pedder Road Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-pedder-road-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Pedder Road Mumbai\")\n\n[Bhulabhai Desai Marg](https://www.magicbricks.com/Bhulabhai-Desai-Marg-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 41,062 - ₹ 69,713 per sqft\n\n4.4 Ratings (2 Reviews)\n\nBhulabhai Desai Marg is a good locality. It is close to good schools, colleges and hospitals. It is well connected to all parts of South Mumbai. \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Bhulabhai Desai Marg Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-bhulabhai-desai-marg-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Bhulabhai Desai Marg Mumbai\")\n\n[Cumballa Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/Cumbala-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nUpto ₹ 1.7 Lac per sqft\n\n4.4 Ratings (6 Reviews)\n\nIt is a good locality. It is close to good schools colleges and hospitals. It is a cosmopolitan society \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Cumballa Hill Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-cumbala-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Cumballa Hill Mumbai\")\n\nShow More\n\nFlats in Malabar Hill\n\n*   [1 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/1-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [2 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/2-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [3 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/3-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [4 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/4-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [5 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/5-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n\nFlat in Popular Localities of Mumbai\n\n*   [Flats in Andheri East](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-andheri-east-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Chembur](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-chembur-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Borivali West](https://www.magic